    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Muranishi takes to the skies overseas for his climax, Kuroki meets Kawada in Tokyo, politely refuses payment for her unreleased video, and shares her new plans to study abroad. Let's listen in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "きっと情熱的な撮影をしてるんでしょうね、村西監督は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "うん、君のおかげだよ。本当に出演料は大丈夫なの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "もちろんです。発売されていないならギャラなんて頂けません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "それに私、モデルのお仕事なんかも始めましたので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "留学するお金には困らないと思います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まさか他のビデオにも？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まあ、君が決めることだ。うちが何か言うことはないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "撮影、ホントに成功するといいですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、最高に輝いてますよ！すばらしい、すばらしすぎる！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうです、では撃ちましょう！カーット！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "終わったか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やったぞー！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "きっと情熱的な撮影をしてるんでしょうね、村西監督は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Muranishi must be in the middle of a passionate shoot right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "うん、君のおかげだよ。本当に出演料は大丈夫なの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, and it's thanks to you. Are you really sure about turning down your fee?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "もちろんです。発売されていないならギャラなんて頂けません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course. Since the tape hasn't gone on sale, I couldn't possibly accept the fee.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "それに私、モデルのお仕事なんかも始めましたので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, I've also started doing modelling work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "留学するお金には困らないと思います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I don't think I'll have trouble saving money to study abroad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まさか他のビデオにも？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't tell me you'll appear in other videos too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まあ、君が決めることだ。うちが何か言うことはないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, that's for you to decide. It isn't our place to say anything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "撮影、ホントに成功するといいですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I truly hope his shoot succeeds.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、最高に輝いてますよ！すばらしい、すばらしすぎる！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, you are shining brighter than ever! Wonderful, too wonderful!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうです、では撃ちましょう！カーット！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's right, now fire! Cut!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "終わったか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sounds like it's done.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やったぞー！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did it!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
